  "causalSequence": [
    "season chuck pieces; brown in batches in oil",
    "soften onion, garlic (plus carrot, celery, parsnip, swede in one build) in same pan",
    "stir in tomato paste; cook 1 min",
    "add flour or reserve cornflour for a late slurry",
    "add stock, tomatoes, thyme, bay; combine with beef in slow cooker or covered pot",
    "cook low 8 h (slow cooker) or lowest stovetop heat 2-3 h until beef pulls apart",
    "add potatoes, carrots for the final hour if not in from the start",
    "thicken with cornflour slurry; cook 15-60 min more",
    "stir quick-cooking greens through at the end; top with parsley"
